<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - News cut to attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - News cut to attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber has cut its rating for News Corp to attractive from buy, a source at the firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock closed at 23-5/8 on Friday in New York.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
